SUMMARY:North Bay Old-Time Session
DESCRIPTION:The jam is led by Chris Carney and Janette Duncan\, first Sundays at the Church of the Oaks in Cotati\, from 3 pm to 5 pm.
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/north-bay-old-time-music-jam/2026-09-06/
LOCATION:Church of the Oaks\, 160 West Sierra\, Cotati\, CA\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam,Old-time
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://californiabluegrass.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/North-Bay-Old-Time-Sessions.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:California Bluegrass Association
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260907T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260907T180000
DTSTAMP:20260303T231826Z
CREATED:20260303T231826Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260303T231826Z
UID:344893-1788804000-1788804000@californiabluegrass.org
SUMMARY:Garage Jam
DESCRIPTION:The Garage Jam is an open\, friendly bluegrass circle that meets the first and third Monday of every month\, from 6 to 8 pm. All kinds of pickers show up\, from rank beginners to grizzled veterans\, plus folks who just come to listen and socialize. The repertoire is straight-up traditional bluegrass\, although the occasional old-time or folk-inflected choice will pop up. The format is the old-fashioned song circle\, with each participant getting a turn to call a song and set its key\, pace\, and feel. An experienced jam leader and bass player are always present to help keep things on track. Everyone is welcome — come on down!
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/garage-jam/2026-09-07/
LOCATION:Out West Garage\, 321 2nd St\, Petaluma\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://californiabluegrass.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20210607_192219.jpg
END:VEVENT
