SUMMARY:Sonoma Town Bluegrass Jam
DESCRIPTION:At the Sonoma Community Center 6:30 – 8:30pm on the 2nd and 4th Monday of each month.\n276 E. Napa St.  room 210\, Sonoma\nAll bluegrass instruments and levels are welcome to come and pick! \n(Formerly called the Reel Roadhouse jam.)
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/sonoma-town-bluegrass-jam-formerly-the-reel-roadhouse-jamnew-time-and-place/2026-09-14/
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center\, 276 E. Napa\, Sonoma\, CA\, 95476\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam
