SUMMARY:Pottery Jam
DESCRIPTION:A friendly bluegrass jam for all experience levels\, hosted by Peter Schurch on the third Sunday of every month at 4:30 pm\, at the ceramics studio attached to the Sebastopol Center for the Arts in Ives Park.
