UID:341822-1790521200-1790528400@californiabluegrass.org
SUMMARY:The Cafe Jam
DESCRIPTION:A friendly open bluegrass jam for players of all levels\, ages\, genders. This is not a slow jam! Although you may hear slow songs called. Try to come without music stands or song sheets if you possibly can. After the jam\, stick around and enjoy the evening’s live entertainment over dinner!
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/the-cafe-jam/2026-09-27/
LOCATION:Redwood Cafe\, 8240 Old Redwood Hwy\,\, Cotati\, CA\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam
END:VEVENT
