SUMMARY:Occidental Jam
DESCRIPTION:Led by multi-instrumentalist David Pascoe\, our monthly jam session is held on the first Tuesday of each month. We’ll meet in the OCA classroom and take turns leading/choosing songs. Guaranteed to be a great time for all! $5 donation requested of participants. BYOB.
